DXController
============

This folder is DXController's, a mod by dsgls that gives Deus Ex full
controller support: a weapon and augmentation wheel, the pad in every
menu, conversation and in-world device, an on-screen keyboard. DXLauncher
plays a profile with it while the profile's option is on (Settings,
Controller).

  DXController.u          the mod's scripts: the author's own build of
                          release v1.6.1, unchanged, as its release zip
                          DXController-v1.6.1.zip carries it
  DeusEx-v1.6.1.dxlpatch  a binary difference, made by DXLauncher's
                          tools/dxpatch.py, from the game's stock DeusEx.u
                          to the one release v1.6.1 carries: with it
                          DXLauncher makes that DeusEx.u on the player's
                          machine, from the player's own copy
  COPYING                 the GNU General Public License, version 3
  README                  this file

DXController is free software by dsgls, licensed under the GNU General
Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version, as its
README says. The source of DXController.u is the mod's repository at the
tag v1.6.1 (its DXController/Classes, with the scripts that build it):

  https://github.com/dsgls/DXController/tree/v1.6.1

The changed DeusEx.u is Ion Storm's package with the mod's hooks in it;
the mod's README makes no licence claim on it, and no DeusEx.u ships
here. The patch holds the bytes of the changed DeusEx.u that the stock one
lacks, and is of use only with the game's own DeusEx.u of the GOG and
Steam editions. The changes it carries are in the mod's repository at the
same tag (its DeusEx/Classes).

DXLauncher and DXEngine are under the zlib licence; they carry
DXController beside them, and the GPL covers DXController, not them.
